16:["$","p","Keep a research sheet with the official URL, the date checked and any unanswered requirement. This reduces the risk of relying on an old summary or applying to a programme that does not fit your profile.",{"children":"Keep a research sheet with the official URL, the date checked and any unanswered requirement. This reduces the risk of relying on an old summary or applying to a programme that does not fit your profile."}]
